rs show Hinson slightly ahead. Most expert raters call the race a tossup, with one rating it Lean Democratic and one Tilt Republican.\n\nHinson holds a clear cash-on-hand advantage, but Turek has benefited heavily from outside spending. Prediction markets give Hinson a slight edge, reflecting Iowa's Republican lean. The race sits right at the tossup line, with a small Democratic tilt from recent polling offset by fundamentals in a state Trump carried comfortably.", "history": [{"date": "2026-09-22", "p_dem": 0.6012, "margin": 1.25}, {"date": "2026-09-23", "p_dem": 0.5782, "margin": 0.8}, {"date": "2026-09-24", "p_dem": 0.5857, "margin": 0.8}]}